    "description": "Indicator for use with analog load cells, supporting single-interval and multi-interval weighing ranges. Load cell connection: 6-wire (remote sensing) or 4-wire; when a 4-wire connection is used the load cells are connected directly without a junction box. Power supply: 100-240 V AC 50/60 Hz or 6-9 V DC battery (not suitable for a road vehicle power supply). Software version numbers: PEO0xx (LED display) or PCO0xx (LCD display), where xx is a number between 00 and 99; the identification number is displayed after pressing 'Print' and 'Hold' together to enter the manual, navigating to setting C38 and pressing 'Print'."
